  "question": {
    "text": "The number of&nbsp;<math><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></math> matrices <math><mi>M</mi></math> with entries from <math><mo>{</mo><mn>0,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>}</mo></math>, such that the sum of the diagonal elements of <math><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mi>M</mi></math> is <math><mn>5</mn></math>, are"
