  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>e</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>f</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>g</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>h</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>i</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Sum of the diagonal elements,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Tr</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mtext>&#8203;</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>M</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo></math> where entries are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Only two cases are possible.</p><p>(I) Five entries are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> and other fourare&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>(II) One entry is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>, one entry is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> and others are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Total cases<math><mo>=</mo><mn>126</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>72</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>198</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
